NOTE ON CONTENT LICENSING

The MIT licence above covers the SOFTWARE — the code in server/, public/js/,
public/css/ and scripts/.

It does NOT cover the species photographs in public/img/species/. Those are the
work of their respective photographers and are used under their own licences
(CC0, public domain, CC BY, or CC BY-SA). Each image's creator and licence is
recorded in server/data/species-images.json and shown on the card that displays
it. Reusing an image requires complying with ITS licence, not this one.

The species text, depth ranges and field notes are written for this project and
are covered by the MIT licence along with the code.